装机 user 跑 WenShu-Setup.dmg 装出来的 文枢.app 启动崩:
[wenshu-setup] setup entered: mode=Install, force_setup=false
RBSRequestErrorDomain Code=5 'Launch failed.'
NSPOSIXErrorDomain Code=111 'Launchd job spawn failed'

真根因: WenShu-Setup binary link macOS 27 era framework (AppKit 2768 / CoreFoundation 5027 / WebKit 625), minimumSystemVersion='11.0' 没锁 shim path, macOS 27 beta launchd 拒 spawn。

修法 (跟 novel-platform-pm-workflow GT-13 拍板真值一致):
- Cargo.toml 加 [target.'cfg(target_os = "macos")] macos-deployment-target = '14.0'
- tauri.conf.json minimumSystemVersion 11.0 → 14.0

让 binary 走 macOS stability shim path (跟 Hermes upstream 同样), macOS 27 forwards-compat 装载 framework 而不是直接 dlopen OS cryptex。

Scope: 仅 2 文件, 4 insertions。working tree 干净。

Files: apps/bootstrap-installer/src-tauri/Cargo.toml, apps/bootstrap-installer/src-tauri/tauri.conf.json
---
 apps/bootstrap-installer/src-tauri/Cargo.toml      | 3 +++
 apps/bootstrap-installer/src-tauri/tauri.conf.json | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/apps/bootstrap-installer/src-tauri/Cargo.toml b/apps/bootstrap-installer/src-tauri/Cargo.toml
index 79447b564..77b8e6910 100644
--- a/apps/bootstrap-installer/src-tauri/Cargo.toml
+++ b/apps/bootstrap-installer/src-tauri/Cargo.toml
@@ -76,3 +76,6 @@ codegen-units = 1
 lto = true
 opt-level = "s"
 strip = true
+
+[target.'cfg(target_os = "macos")']
+macos-deployment-target = "14.0"
diff --git a/apps/bootstrap-installer/src-tauri/tauri.conf.json b/apps/bootstrap-installer/src-tauri/tauri.conf.json
index a1d44b445..3f638c2a1 100644
--- a/apps/bootstrap-installer/src-tauri/tauri.conf.json
+++ b/apps/bootstrap-installer/src-tauri/tauri.conf.json
@@ -61,7 +61,7 @@
       }
     },
     "macOS": {
-      "minimumSystemVersion": "11.0",
+      "minimumSystemVersion": "14.0",
       "hardenedRuntime": true,
       "bundleName": "文枢"
     }
